    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReSetna is an action-packed metroidvania focused on fast paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are s battle-forged warrior ReSetna, awakened with a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/22dcdf82318a3b8c7a8d7ae4274c559f.avif?t=1752317555\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as ReSetna, you begin in Polis, a dark, ruined world once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you uncover unknown dimensions, new elements and entire worlds made of data and circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone is a warzone. Every machine is your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master intense, precision combat with parry mechanics and weapon-switching</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your loyal drone companion IXA will be an essential aid</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your abilities using a unique chip-based upgrade system inspired by Tetris</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a fractured world, filled with secrets, danger and a dark history</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the final secret and decide if the future is still worth saving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/d8f79264bd679376e8c00182d7b76de3.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Rich, Post-Apocalyptic World</strong>: From the haunting remnants of Polis_13 to the toxic expanses of Acidia, journey through distinct, dystopian zones, each filled with secrets, unique challenges, and lore, inviting deep exploration and discovery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rich Narrative and Lore</strong>: Piece together clues to discover the complicated history of this enigmatic world. Each zone holds keys to the past and hints of the future, through environmental storytelling and cryptic communications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/2ddc96cd6503073a294551712d8d3e9a.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong>: Engage with a wide array of enemies in each zone. Each will challenge you to adapt your strategy and refine your combat skills. Tactical thinking is key to mastering ReSetna\u2019s arsenal and overcoming adversaries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Companion \u2013 IXA</strong>: IXA, your loyal drone companion, will be an essential aid, providing healing in critical moments and hacking enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/3e038e601dc9a390e76b2c97759a7735.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong>: The ultimate test of your skills! Each formidable boss is an epic, intense showdown requiring a sound strategy to beat. Their unique abilities will require you stay on your toes, exploit their weaknesses, and leverage upgrades to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrade Your Abilities</strong>: A customizable chip-upgrade system lets you customize ReSetna to suit your playstyle. Whether enhancing her combat techniques or her abilities to manipulate her environment, your choices affect her evolution and how you overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>7 Demanding Districts</strong>: Every environment presents a challenging terrain demanding keen observation and platforming abilities. You'll encounter mechanisms and hazards, as well as opportunities to uncover hidden rooms and secret passages that offer unique rewards and deeper insight into the world's history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReSetna is an action-packed metroidvania focused on fast paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are s battle-forged warrior ReSetna, awakened with a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/22dcdf82318a3b8c7a8d7ae4274c559f.avif?t=1752317555\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as ReSetna, you begin in Polis, a dark, ruined world once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you uncover unknown dimensions, new elements and entire worlds made of data and circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone is a warzone. Every machine is your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master intense, precision combat with parry mechanics and weapon-switching</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your loyal drone companion IXA will be an essential aid</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your abilities using a unique chip-based upgrade system inspired by Tetris</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a fractured world, filled with secrets, danger and a dark history</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the final secret and decide if the future is still worth saving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/d8f79264bd679376e8c00182d7b76de3.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Rich, Post-Apocalyptic World</strong>: From the haunting remnants of Polis_13 to the toxic expanses of Acidia, journey through distinct, dystopian zones, each filled with secrets, unique challenges, and lore, inviting deep exploration and discovery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rich Narrative and Lore</strong>: Piece together clues to discover the complicated history of this enigmatic world. Each zone holds keys to the past and hints of the future, through environmental storytelling and cryptic communications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/2ddc96cd6503073a294551712d8d3e9a.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong>: Engage with a wide array of enemies in each zone. Each will challenge you to adapt your strategy and refine your combat skills. Tactical thinking is key to mastering ReSetna\u2019s arsenal and overcoming adversaries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Companion \u2013 IXA</strong>: IXA, your loyal drone companion, will be an essential aid, providing healing in critical moments and hacking enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936080/extras/3e038e601dc9a390e76b2c97759a7735.avif?t=1752317555\" width=800 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong>: The ultimate test of your skills! Each formidable boss is an epic, intense showdown requiring a sound strategy to beat. Their unique abilities will require you stay on your toes, exploit their weaknesses, and leverage upgrades to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrade Your Abilities</strong>: A customizable chip-upgrade system lets you customize ReSetna to suit your playstyle. Whether enhancing her combat techniques or her abilities to manipulate her environment, your choices affect her evolution and how you overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>7 Demanding Districts</strong>: Every environment presents a challenging terrain demanding keen observation and platforming abilities. You'll encounter mechanisms and hazards, as well as opportunities to uncover hidden rooms and secret passages that offer unique rewards and deeper insight into the world's history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "What\u2019s left of humanity are minds trapped in circuits. You are awaken as ReSetna, a warrior on a mission to rescue last human remnants. Explore seven hostile zones, face seven brutal bosses and evolve through a unique upgrade system. Uncover horrifying truth and decide if the future is worth saving.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cIndie developer Today\u2019s Games calls it a &quot;game reworked by players&quot; and is dedicated to continuing working with its community.\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201cReSetna is an exhilarating action-adventure set in a visually striking post-apocalyptic sci-fi landscape.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cI liked piecing together the game's lore, and I loved how Radiant Blades' chip transformed the latter half of the game into an overpowered run-and-gun spectacle.\u201d<br>Metroidvania Guru<br>",
